[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[7G\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m10\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[48;2;4;71;0ma\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m \u001b[48;2;4;71;0msnapshot into a candidate world \u001b[48;2;2;40;0m([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mwhat \u001b[48;2;4;71;0mR03\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m left it\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](stage-5-recovery-plan.md#what-it-leaves))\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m:\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m11\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mno\u001b[14Ghing\u001b[19Gremoves a batch yet, and an idle server writes 16 GB of blocks a day. Ope\u001b[93G for th\u001b[101G user:   \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m2\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mwhether an idle server commits a second's steps ahead rather than every 21 ms. A world is its   \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m3\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mbuild's\u001b[19G(D-111), and a build\u001b[40Gis its\u001b[47Gtre\u001b[51Gs (`cmake/Revision.cmake`), so\u001b[83Gny edit u\u001b[93Gder `source` or\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m4\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m`cmak\u001b[17G`\u001b[19Gmakes a\u001b[27Gwo\u001b[30Gld of the build before\u001b[53Guno\u001b[57Gen\u001b[60Gble:\u001b[65Gdelete\u001b[72Git. A r\u001b[80Gmote view\u001b[90Gmay be 192\u001b[101GKiB\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m5\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m(`Remote::kMaxMessageBytes`); pas\u001b[45G about 256 KiB an unreliable message\u001b[82Gdoes no\u001b[91Garrive, and a view\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m6\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mwants deltas ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mhistory\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](history.md#r02-durable-io-directories-and-the-world-lock--2026-11-24)).        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[2m 17 \u001b[22m W22, the drives past the torch, waits for the first larger hull. Jettison's station traffic lanes\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 18 \u001b[22m were measured and parked (`fixture_traffic`, 2026-11-22), to be taken up when it fails. A commit is\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m9\u001b[11G\u001b[22mgated in\u001b[20Gthe second checkout, `build/gate-\u001b[54Gr\u001b[56Ge`, with `--tidy`, edi\u001b[79Ging alone beside it\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mMade \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m scratchpad edit \u001b[38;2;56;166;96m+36\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m, ran \u001b[1m5\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mCommitting R03 in Manifest locally, then running its\u001b[56Gfull\u001b[61Ggate\u001b[66G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m--werror --asan --tidy\u001b[39m)\u001b[91Gin\u001b[94Gthe\u001b[98Gsecond\u001b[105Gcheckout.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, ran \u001b[1m6\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mManifest's gate\u001b[19Gpassed (59 of 59 tests under\u001b[48GASan,\u001b[54Gtidy\u001b[59Gclean).\u001b[67GNow\u001b[71Grecording\u001b[81GR03\u001b[85Gin\u001b[88GJettison's\u001b[99Groadmap\u001b[107Gand\u001b[111Ghistory\r\u001b[1B  and committing that.\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
