[0.371, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H  but a request arriving mid-second would wait for the next commit. I left it as measured, since the plan says measure\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbefore changing the protocol.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[1mThings to know\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GAny edit under \u001b[38;2;177;185;249msource\u001b[27G\u001b[39mor \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcmake\u001b[39m makes a\u001b[44Gworld\u001b[50Gfrom\u001b[55Gthe\u001b[59Gprevious\u001b[68Gbuild\u001b[74Gunopenable,\u001b[86Gby\u001b[89Gdesign\u001b[96Gof\u001b[99GD-111;\u001b[106Gdelete\u001b[113Gthe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bworld\u001b[11Gdirectory.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- Jettison's roadmap\u001b[24Gand\u001b[28Ghistory\u001b[36Gare\u001b[40Gupdated\u001b[48Gin\u001b[51G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m487915c\u001b[39m,\u001b[60Gdocs\u001b[65Gonly,\u001b[71Gso\u001b[74Gno\u001b[77Gengine\u001b[84Ggate\u001b[89Gwas\u001b[93Grun.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GNext\u001b[10Gis\u001b[13GR04:\u001b[18Gboundary\u001b[27Gsnapshots,\u001b[38Gretention\u001b[48Gand\u001b[52Greplay\u001b[59Gfrom\u001b[64Ga\u001b[66Gsnapshot.\u001b[76GIt\u001b[79Gis\u001b[82Gdesign-heavy\u001b[95Gagain\u001b[101G(save\u001b[107Gsection,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  can\u001b[9Gidate world), so I'd keep this model at\u001b[49Ghigh effort, and\u001b[66Gsta\u001b[70Gt\u001b[72Git\u001b[75Gin a fresh session; \u001b[96Ghe ha\u001b[102Gdo\u001b[105Gf is in\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  Manif\u001b[11Gst'\u001b[15G \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdocs/session-handoff.md\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BNot\u001b[7Gdone\u001b[12Gor\u001b[15Gnot\u001b[19Gchecked:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GA\u001b[7Gkill\u001b[12Gat\u001b[15Geach\u001b[20Gexact\u001b[26Gcommit\u001b[33Gboundary\u001b[42Gin\u001b[45Ga\u001b[47Gseparate\u001b[56Gprocess\u001b[64Gis\u001b[67Gleft\u001b[72Gto\u001b[75GR04;\u001b[80G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcli_serve\u001b[90G\u001b[39