[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat it does to the work:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GKept\u001b[10Gfrom\u001b[15GR02/R03:\u001b[24Gthe\u001b[28Gworld\u001b[34Gdirectory\u001b[44Gand\u001b[48Gits\u001b[52Glock,\u001b[58Gthe\u001b[62Gidentity\u001b[71Gfile\u001b[76Gand\u001b[80Gbuild\u001b[86Gcheck\u001b[92G(a\u001b[95Gsave\u001b[100Gstill\u001b[106Gmust\u001b[111Gonly\u001b[116Gload\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  in the build that made it),\u001b[33G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m--world\u001b[39m,\u001b[42Gand\u001b[46Gthe\u001b[50Gcommand\u001b[58Glisting.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BR\u001b[7Gmoved from R03: the batch files, the\u001b[44Gcatalogue \u001b[55Ghain, the replay, and the server holding receipts back.\u001b[111G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GR04 shrinks to \"write a snapshot every 30 s,\u001b[50Gl\u001b[52Gad the newest good\u001b[71Gone\u001b[75Gat\u001b[78Gstart,\u001b[85Grefuse\u001b[92Ganother\u001b[100Gbuild's\".\u001b[110GR05's\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gbackup bec\u001b[17Ges copying \u001b[29G file. Most of\u001b[44Gthe fault-injection matrix goes away.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI'd make\u001b[12Gthis change as the start \u001b[38Gf R04: r\u001b[47Gcord it in the decision\u001b[71Gledger \u001b[79Gs yours,\u001b[88Gsuperseding\u001b[100GD-112,\u001b[107Gstrip\u001b[113Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bjournal,\u001b[12Gand\u001b[16Gadd\u001b[20Gthe\u001b[24Gperiodic\u001b[33Gsnapshot.\u001b[43GSay\u001b[47Ggo\u001b[50Gand\u001b[54GI'll\u001b[59Gdo\u001b[62Git.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BN\u001b[5Gt measure\u001b[15G: real SSD write volume includin\u001b[48G filesystem \u001b[61Gverhead,\u001b[70Gand\u001b[74Ghow\u001b[78Glong\u001b[83Gwriting\u001b[91Ga\u001b[93Gsnapshot\u001b[102Gpauses\u001b[109Gthe\u001b[113Gstep\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bloop.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCogitated for 49s · done 10:04 am\r\u001b[2B\u0