, and still a quarter of what the journal writes now with about 1/900th\u001b[119Gof\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe\u001b[7Gflushes.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
