[0.004, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5GLost in\u001b[13Ga\u001b[15Gclean\u001b[21Gstop\u001b[36GNothing  \u001b[46G   \u001b[50G      \u001b[59GNothing \u001b[68G \u001b[86GNothing \u001b[95G \r\u001b[4C\u001b[2BRecovery \u001b[15G     \u001b[21G  \u001b[24G     \u001b[30G   \u001b[36GReplay every batch  \u001b[59GLoad one\u001b[68Gfile\u001b[73G          \u001b[86GLoad one\u001b[95Gfile\u001b[100G          \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B└\u001b[34G┴\u001b[57G┴\u001b[84G┴\u001b[111G┘\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BSo 10 s costs three times the writes of 30 s, and still a quarter of what the journal writes now with about 1/900th\u001b[119Gof\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe flushes.\u001b[34G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe\u001b[7Gwrite\u001b[13Gfigure\u001b[20Gscales\u001b[27Gwith\u001b[32Gthe\u001b[36Gsave's\u001b[43Gsize,\u001b[49Gwhich\u001b[55Gwill\u001b[60Ggrow\u001b[65Gas\u001b[68Gthe\u001b[72Gworld\u001b[78Gdoes:\u001b[84Ga\u001b[86G2\u001b[88GMB\u001b[91Gworld\u001b[97Gat\u001b[100G10\u001b[103Gs\u001b[105Gwould\u001b[111Gbe\u001b[114Gabout\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B17\u001b[6GGB/day, back wh\u001b[22Gre the\u001b[29Gjournal i\u001b[40Gtoday. Th\u001b[50Gt i\u001b[54G the\u001b[59Gmain argument for\u001b[77G30 s \u001b[83Gver 10 s, or\u001b[96Gf\u001b[98Gr\u001b[100Gmaking the\u001b[111Ginterval a\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsetting.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[2Bse figures are arithmetic\u001b[32Gfrom th\u001b[40G one m\u001b[47Gasured save size;\u001b[65Gfilesystem overhead and the pause a snapshot causes in\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe step loop are still unmeasured.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCogitated for 8s · done 10:07 am\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mtry and gues how much data we would be saving if there were 256 players and enough worlds and trades scaled up from \u001b[39m  \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mwhat we have now. then show those tables again\u001b[39m                                                                        \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✢\u001b[3GStewing… \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0023 ─\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[38C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
