[0.114, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BFlushes    \u001b[30G88 per second\u001b[46G2 per\u001b[52G10 s      \u001b[88G2 per\u001b[95G0 s      \r\u001b[4C\u001b[2BPa\u001b[9Ge per\u001b[15Gsave\u001b[23GNone \u001b[29G   \u001b[33G   \u001b[37G      \u001b[46G110 MB serialised\u001b[64Gand\u001b[68Gwritten\u001b[76Geach\u001b[81Gtime\u001b[88GSam\u001b[92G \u001b[94G  \u001b[97G \r\u001b[4C\u001b[2BLost in a\u001b[15Gcrash\u001b[25Gthing\u001b[31Gacknowledged\u001b[46GUp to 10 s       \u001b[64G   \u001b[68G       \u001b[76G    \u001b[81G    \u001b[88GUp to\u001b[94G30\u001b[97Gs\r\u001b[4C\u001b[2BRecovery \u001b[15G     \u001b[23GReplay every batch  \u001b[46GLoad one\u001b[55Gfile\u001b[88GLoad one\u001b[97Gfile\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B└\u001b[21G┴\u001b[44G┴\u001b[86G┴\u001b[108G┘\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mWhy the journal stays at 16 GB:\u001b[22m it writes what happened, not the whole world, and a batch with a few requests\u001b[115Gstill\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bfits\u001b[10Gone\u001b[14G4\u001b[16GKiB\u001b[20Gblock.\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[1msnapshots balloon:\u001b[22m they rewr\u001b[39Ge everything\u001b[52Gevery time. A\u001b[67Gypical 600 TB-rate\u001b[87Gdrive would l\u001b[101Gst und\u001b[108Gr two years\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bat 10 s and about five\u001b[28Gat\u001b[31G30\u001b[34Gs.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mT\u001b[7Ge\u001b[9Gpause:\u001b[22m at the Debug rate the s\u001b[40Grialise step alone would be about\u001b[74G1.5\u001b[78Gs per snapshot; Re\u001b[97Gease is unmeasured.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat this means\u001b[19G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BFrequent whole-world\u001b[24Gsnapshots\u001b[34Gare\u001b[38Gfine\u001b[43Gat\u001b[46Gtoday's\u001b[54Gsize\u001b[59Gand\u001b[63Gwrong\u001b[69Gat\u001b[72Gthe\u001b[76Gsize\u001b[81Gyou\u001b[85Gare\u001b[89Gaiming\u001b[96Gfor.\u001b[101GThe\u001b[105Gdesign\u001b[112Gthat\u001b[117Gfits\r\u001b[2C\u00