[2.110, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe pause:\u001b[22m at the Debug rate\u001b[34Gthe\u001b[38Gserialise step alone would\u001b[65Gbe\u001b[68Gabo\u001b[72Gt 1.5\u001b[78Gs per snap\u001b[89Ghot; Release\u001b[102Gis\u001b[105Gunmeasured.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat this means\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BFreq\u001b[8Gent whole-world\u001b[24Gsnapshots\u001b[34Gare\u001b[38Gfine at\u001b[46Gtoday's size and w\u001b[65Gong at t\u001b[74Ge size\u001b[81Gyou\u001b[85Gare\u001b[89Gaiming\u001b[96Gfor.\u001b[101GThe\u001b[105Gdesign\u001b[112Gthat\u001b[117Gfits\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\"lose up to 30 s\" at both sizes is a journal flushed every 10–30 s plus a snapshot about once an hour:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B┌\u001b[38G┬\u001b[99G┐\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B        \u001b[40G    \u001b[45G  Journal flush\u001b[61Gd every\u001b[69G30\u001b[72Gs + hourly\u001b[83Gsnapshot\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B├\u001b[38G┼\u001b[99G┤\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B│\u001b[5GDisk\u001b[10Gwrites,\u001b[18G256\u001b[22Gplayers\u001b[38G│\u001b[40GAbout\u001b[46G3.5\u001b[50GGB/day\u001b[57G(0.9\u001b[62GGB\u001b[65Gof\u001b[68Grequests,\u001b[78G2.6\u001b[82GGB\u001b[85Gof\u001b[88Gsnapshots)\u001b[99G│\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B├──────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B│\u001b[5GDisk writes, today's\u001b[27Gorld, idle │\u001b[40GAbout 25 MB/day    \u001b[60G    \u001b[65G       \u001b[73G        \u001b[82G    \u001b[87G   \u001b[91G    \u001b[96G  \u001b[99G│\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B├──────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B│\u001b[5GFlushes   \u001b[16G    \u001b[21G   \u001b[25G        \u001b[34G   \u001b[38G│ 2 per 30 s, plus\u001b[57Gthe\u001b[61Ghourly\u001b[68Gsnapshot\u001b[99G│\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B├──────────────────────────────────┼────────────