[0.004, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mIt is flat because of block rounding, not because the journal is small.\u001b[77G\u001b[22mThe\u001b[81Gserver\u001b[88Gwrites\u001b[95Gabout\u001b[101G47\u001b[104Gbatch\u001b[110Gfiles\u001b[116Ga\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G  \u001b[6Gecond, and\u001b[17Geach takes one 4 KiB\u001b[38Gblock whether it \u001b[56Golds 235 by\u001b[68Ges or\u001b[75G few requests.\u001b[90GAt\u001b[93Gmy a\u001b[98Gsumed 26\u001b[107Grequests a\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  second, a batch averages under 500 bytes.\u001b[47GIt\u001b[50Gwould\u001b[56Gonly\u001b[61Ggrow\u001b[66Gpast\u001b[71G16\u001b[74GGB\u001b[77Gonce\u001b[82Gbatches\u001b[90Gexceed\u001b[97G4\u001b[99GKiB,\u001b[104Gwhich\u001b[110Gis\u001b[113Gseveral\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bhundred\u001b[13Grequests\u001b[22Ga\u001b[24Gsecond.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThe rea\u001b[13G wear is higher than 16 GB.\u001b[22m Each of the four million files a day also costs a direct\u001b[98Gry\u001b[101Gentry, an \u001b[112Gnode and\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bfilesystem-journal writes,\u001b[32Gforced out by about\u001b[52G188 f\u001b[58Gu\u001b[60Ghes a second.\u001b[74GI\u001b[76Gguess\u001b[82Gd two to four\u001b[96Gtimes, so 30–60 GB a day\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Br\u001b[7Gaching the SSD; this is \u001b[32Got measured.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mR03 alone never deletes anything and has no snapshots.\u001b[60G\u001b[22mThe\u001b[64G16\u001b[67GGB\u001b[70Ga\u001b[72Gday\u001b[76Gaccumulates\u001b[88Guntil\u001b[94GR04\u001b[98Gadds\u001b[103Gretention,\u001b[114Gand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Grecovery replays from step 0. With an hourly snapshot of a 110 MB world,\u001b[79Gdd ab\u001b[85Gu\u001b[87G 2.6 GB a da\u001b[100G.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BSo the current\u001b[18Gdesign cost\u001b[31Gthe\u001b[35Gsame h\u001b[42Gavy,\u001b[47Gconstant\u001b[56Gamount\u001b[63Gregardless\u001b[74Gof\u001b[77Gload:\u001b[83Git\u001b[86Gis\u00