[0.278, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BSo the current de\u001b[21Gign co\u001b[29Gs the\u001b[35Gsame\u001b[40Gheavy, con\u001b[51Gt\u001b[53Gnt amount regardless of loa\u001b[81G: it is as\u001b[92Gexpensive\u001b[102Gidle\u001b[107Gwith\u001b[112Gone\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bplayer\u001b[10Gas\u001b[13Gbusy\u001b[18Gwith\u001b[23G256.\u001b[28GThe\u001b[32G30-second\u001b[42Gflush\u001b[48Gdesign\u001b[55Gcosts\u001b[61Gabout\u001b[67G25\u001b[70GMB\u001b[73Ga\u001b[75Gday\u001b[79Gidle\u001b[84Gand\u001b[88Gabout\u001b[94G3.5\u001b[98GGB\u001b[101Ga\u001b[103Gday\u001b[107Gat\u001b[110G256\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bplayers, because it pays per r\u001b[34Gquest\u001b[40Grather\u001b[47Gthan per\u001b[56Gstep.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBaked for 12s · done 10:13 am\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mDoes this mean the journal would actually cause less write wear on an SSD when there are 256 players and need less \u001b[39m   \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mstorage?\u001b[39m                                                                                                              \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m Less wear, yes; less storage, no.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[1mWear at 256 players (writes per day):\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[22m┌──────────────────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B│\u001b[22GDesign\u001b[46G│\u001b[77GWrites\u001b[113G│\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B├\u001b[46G┼\u001b[113G┤\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BCurrent\u001b[13Gjournal,\u001b[22Gplus an\u001b[30Ghourly\u001b[37Gsnapshot\u001b[48GAbout\u001b[54G19\u001b[57GGB\u001b[60Gof\u001b[63Gblocks,\u001b[71Gperhaps 30–60\u001b[85GGB\u001b[88Gwith\u001b[93Gfilesystem\u001b[104Goverhead\r\u001b[4C\u001b[2BWhol\u001b[10G-world snapshot every 30 s\u